            "answer_1": "<p>Seed Oil Capsules are a 100% natural DHT-blocking supplement designed to reduce hair loss and restore thicker, fuller hair. </p><p>Each softgel contains 2000mg of cold-pressed, virgin pumpkin seed oil — one of the most studied natural compounds for hair regrowth in both women and men.</p>",
